Correction to v0.9-beta
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The v0.9-beta release (January 2026) contained EfiGuard-derived code and did NOT
credit it. That release was published under AGPL-3.0, and its third-party
licence file listed Zydis, Zycore, EDK2, Roslyn and the .NET runtime but omitted
EfiGuard entirely. The omission was an oversight, not a position.

This notice is the correction, published unprompted. EfiGuard is the work of
Mattiwatti (https://github.com/Mattiwatti/EfiGuard), released under GPL-3.0, and
the derived files are listed above. The binary artifact attached to that release
has been withdrawn from distribution.

No later version of this project contains EfiGuard-derived code.

